{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47222","headline":"和御制游慈恩寺 · 慈恩寺沙门","name":"和御制游慈恩寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"皇风扇只树，至德茂禅林。\n仙华曜日彩，神旛曳远阴。\n绮殿笼霞影，飞阁出云心。\n细草希慈泽，恩光重更深。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"慈恩寺沙门","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47222.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47222","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}